    <sys:String x:Key="Desc.Tweaks">Windows settings for performance, gaming, interface and network. Every tweak with an explanation, a risk level and undo.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Desc.Privacy">Telemetry, advertising ID, activity history, web search in Start, Copilot and Recall.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Desc.Debloat">Remove preinstalled apps with checkboxes. Reinstalling from the Microsoft Store stays possible.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Desc.Startup">Enable or disable programs at Windows startup without deleting them.</sys:String>
